Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.82,0:00:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride away!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.26,0:00:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.02,0:00:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.86,0:00:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.32,0:00:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.78,0:00:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.48,0:00:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.34,0:00:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, it's dreaming\Nwhere we should be going. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.04,0:01:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.08,0:01:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.14,0:01:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's escape when it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.84,0:01:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,While our dreams are never ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.94,0:01:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.06,0:01:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.02,0:01:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.50,0:01:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.46,0:01:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.46,0:01:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,we will find suspense And then commence\Nto live out another day so intense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.28,0:01:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.04,0:02:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.06,0:02:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Open the map inside your\Nheart and see. No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Our minds will never give up. There's\Na fire in our dreams and you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop it\NWe will be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.64,0:02:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, is everybody ready? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll sneak into the\Nunderground port by taking
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.80,0:02:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,the hidden passage from\Nour current location.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.18,0:02:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We should avoid conflict and\Naim only for our target, Sugar!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.34,0:02:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She may seem harmless,\Nbut she's quite deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.60,0:02:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is knock her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:03:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then every toy in the kingdom\Nwill become human once more! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But the path forward is kind of, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.26,0:03:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,narrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a tight squeeze. I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.04,0:03:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Frawland, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just disconnect your arms\Nand your shoulders, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm sure that passage of yours\Nis real super, but Meeland can't fit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.06,0:03:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we just didn't build it for\Nbig people or for extra big people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.40,0:03:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to enter through\Nthe toy house instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.98,0:03:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The toy house is located at the base of\Nthe plateau that the palace is built on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.14,0:03:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where the toys must\Nreturn to every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans aren't allowed to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I see and you call it a house cuz the toys\Nlive there No, it's a house in name only.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no beds for sleeping there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a hidden passage leading\Ndownward to the port. What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a moment's rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.06,0:04:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the toys are forced on the ground every
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.84,0:04:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,night and slave away\Nuntil the morning comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So those toys in the city have to put on a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,show all day after slaving away all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.10,0:04:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor things!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What a cruel fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,so you said Frohling could get to the\NSmile Factory through the toy house?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.26,0:04:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.17,0:04:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There are four ways in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,However, all of them are tightly guarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.40,0:04:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That suits me just fine, little buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.48,0:04:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.39,0:04:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,See, while I'm there, I'll\Nraise some hell for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But aren't we sneaking in?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sneaking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.94,0:04:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.90,0:04:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,While I'm drawing everyone's attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you slip it all quiet-like\Nand take down sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who is that weirdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.76,0:05:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are his pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with his head?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's just crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a triple chin too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second—we know this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.02,0:05:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Cyborg Franky from the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.86,0:05:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,hats
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, senor, you can't just bite\Nright into a tomato like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You need a napkin, it's too juicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, senor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so hard-boiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of me, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:06:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be better off\Nwith a man your own age.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.32,0:06:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But we, like you, don't\Nturn us away, senor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...like kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, senor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let us stay, senor! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Senor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.64,0:06:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a load of that pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.68,0:06:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one to talk! Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.34,0:06:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the east entrance\Nto the toy house reporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're under enemy attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock, knock! Let me hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons left!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.66,0:06:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.06,0:06:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a member of the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyborg Franky is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys are out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.02,0:07:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This nation is affiliated\Nwith the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.30,0:07:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your job to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The party's starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Toy house, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we already\Nknow their objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Smile Factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know what happens\Nif they make it that far?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We turn them all into toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.48,0:07:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That sound good to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.24,0:08:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so clueless, dummies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They sure will be surprised, won't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so. Oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost at the train port. Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.84,0:08:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, it's Frawlind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.70,0:08:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's wreaking havoc at the\Ntoy house, just as promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.54,0:08:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.82,0:08:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,See, while I'm there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go race some hell for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he stays safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Frawlind's a super cyborg\Nafter all. Be that as it may,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I just received word that\Nfour of the family executives
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.68,0:08:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,have been sent to guard\Nthe toyhouse. Is that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.14,0:08:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They are fearsome skilled fighters
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.86,0:08:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All members of the Diamante army.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the biggest stars in\Nthe whole Coliseum In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.12,0:08:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in all the matches that they fought,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,they've never lost once and that\Ngoes for all four of them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.68,0:08:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a heck of a record!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.98,0:09:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't the fighters in the Coliseum\Nsupposed to be tough though?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They are which means one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.52,0:09:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So just how many tough guys are we\Nup against? There's ten executives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,each leading two thousand men spread\Nout across the entire kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.76,0:09:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's three top executives\Nthat stand above even them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,each of the three command their\Nown army with unique features.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,First the treble army members\Nall have special abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,like Sugar,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.36,0:09:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Violet,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.94,0:09:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and Geola.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.98,0:09:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, there's the Diamante Army,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.02,0:10:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,consisting of strong fighters\Nlike Lao-Gi, Mokweiss,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Senor Pink and Dellinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.92,0:10:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And then there's Peacock\Nwith his commando unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.40,0:10:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He commands Gladius,\NBuffalo, and Baby Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we fought with those last two\Nbefore we got here, and they were tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.56,0:10:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's two more who\Nare operating overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Another top exec, Vergo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.12,0:10:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And a regular exec, Monet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So we don't have to face the team\Nwith all the strong fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.64,0:10:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's on Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That team may be the\Nmost deadly of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.56,0:10:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to tell me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.64,0:11:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.88,0:11:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Usalind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.16,0:11:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.14,0:11:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the enemy base.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.22,0:11:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The factory is right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.60,0:11:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that would explain\Nall the factory noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be coming from above, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.40,0:11:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who dropped this box?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.30,0:11:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.48,0:11:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, it fell on top of a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep working.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.52,0:11:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me see my family. Your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.16,0:11:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing you're going\Nto see is the scrap heap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything but that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still make my quota. Have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.28,0:11:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin, did you? Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:11:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just do business with someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.70,0:12:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that is a rotten deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd clean your clock\Nif it wasn't for Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.72,0:12:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got a whole port city down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,To be
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,continued...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He stalks the battlefield like a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.10,0:13:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, like a grim reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that I did, it was\Nall for the sake of my country.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A land that I once loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you say the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of Dressrosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.10,0:13:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The people truly seem to despise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.46,0:13:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be suffocating living\Nunder the weight of their contempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.30,0:13:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how hard it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how much they hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.74,0:13:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All I want is to live together\Nwith Soldier in Peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a beautiful, such\Na detestable display!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's hear it for the final\N30 competitors here in Block D!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.46,0:13:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Another man is down forever, an animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The lion Agyo is truly the king of beasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.82,0:14:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,making the Coliseum run red with\Nthe blood of his countless victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet even a king must kneel\Nbefore the might of Orlumbus' whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.10,0:14:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.80,0:14:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our strongest competitors\Nare still in the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.18,0:14:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But we may see an upset\Nfrom an unknown fighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.56,0:14:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, only one can advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They've all got their sights on Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's going to take her head?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier, I don't know where you are\Nright now, but please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.70,0:14:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The soldier went on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.40,0:15:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.88,0:15:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,While we're down here, he'll be busy\Npreparing for the next leg of the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we take out Sugar, Doflamingo will\Nbe vulnerable to a surprise attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.94,0:15:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's headed to the palace with a\Nteam of Tantata to assassinate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.26,0:15:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll be fine because we\Nhave a legendary hero like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take command of Operation\NSOP and do battle with Sugar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.30,0:15:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Only you can lead us to victory! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me the most important job!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.42,0:15:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.38,0:15:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where we are right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All the bridges in this area move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.48,0:15:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take a look at that\Nbuilding in the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:15:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The one that looks like a sea anemone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.22,0:16:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the executive tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.84,0:16:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where our target sugar will be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.08,0:16:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop screwing around and get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.48,0:16:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I don't see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.90,0:16:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They found us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What ship do you work on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just an innocent passerby, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to ignore me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't allow when you want to get\Noff the ship, except the brokers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.46,0:16:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows that now in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Naked and buried, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.26,0:16:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Usalin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.46,0:17:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Robalin, your disguises.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.50,0:17:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.48,0:17:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.14,0:17:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretending you were scared gave\Nus the perfect chance to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.16,0:17:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are all of you guys that strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That attack really packed a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.60,0:17:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty average for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.52,0:17:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, that's nothing\Ncompared to your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.04,0:17:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,people from Nolan's\Nbloodline can take down
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,sea kings are great. Really\Nthink I'm some kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,super-powered monster\Ndon't they you know what
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,fine I think I have a\Nplan maybe I can pull this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Off without fighting. All\Nright, listen to Zeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I am taking command of\Nthis operation our target
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,is a little girl right\Nso we're not gonna fight
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,her we're gonna scare her\Nout of our wits Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.52,0:17:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, actually, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead the way, my brave friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,To the tower! Straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get in the lift!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an intruder at the toy house!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.92,0:18:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of the straw hat pirates, Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.96,0:18:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The report says he's at the east\Nentrance fighting with Senor Pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.52,0:18:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's aiming for the factory on this floor
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck out there if we take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We should get a nice bonus
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.78,0:18:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap like how much well\Nhis bounty is pretty high
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we'll be stuck\Ngoing up and down in here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.24,0:18:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take over the lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.76,0:18:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait here for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm seizing this lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.54,0:18:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.02,0:19:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The soldier from the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.12,0:19:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you get in here?\NWhere'd he go? Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.62,0:19:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Little punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.88,0:19:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.08,0:19:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's domestic violence!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.10,0:19:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's child abuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You were supposed to dodge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.38,0:19:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If it was up to me, I\Nwouldn't hit you at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then don't follow through with your swing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.28,0:19:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You need a sense of danger\Nto improve yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now focus! Once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Human instinct is powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're much stronger than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look within yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me the strength of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.46,0:19:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you know\Nabout that? You're a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.80,0:19:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're still too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.18,0:19:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.74,0:19:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to practice anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you keep protecting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm nothing but a toy,\Nbeaten by the wind and rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My body rusts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.40,0:20:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how long I can continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.06,0:20:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.40,0:20:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Become strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.28,0:20:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This body is not meant to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.28,0:20:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps toys only exist to\Nbe broken from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the children who play\Nwith them become adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.34,0:20:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.58,0:20:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.66,0:20:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I failed you as a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.20,0:20:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All I could teach you is how to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.54,0:21:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody warned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy was so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is a toy like you even want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.36,0:21:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you fighting us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here because I want a kingdom at\Npeace, where my child can live happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To that end, I shall fight for King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.70,0:21:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.00,0:21:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lay my life on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I must see this mission through.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.78,0:21:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.90,0:21:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have blinked and missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So it seems the rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm speechless, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.84,0:21:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that, the\Nwhole ring is out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the top contenders have\Nbeen felled in an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.08,0:22:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No one, no one is left standing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.76,0:22:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.02,0:22:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The match has ended in an instant,\Nbut there's no winner to speak of!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.34,0:22:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.46,0:22:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In the smoke, one fighter begins to rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.70,0:22:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
